# Kamal secrets from 1Password (Vault: "TheMarzLibrary", Item: "Production").
#
# `op read` is used rather than `kamal secrets fetch --adapter 1password`: that
# adapter shells out to `op signin` and always passes --account, both of which a
# service account token rejects. This line works under either auth mode - the
# desktop app when you run kamal yourself, or OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN
# (~/.config/op/marzlibrary.env) when @admin deploys from Mattermost.
KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=$(op read "op://TheMarzLibrary/Production/KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD")
